m a Democratic-sponsored pollster. With no fresh high-quality polls, the forecast leans on fundamentals, ratings, and markets, which together suggest a Democratic edge of several points with meaningful uncertainty.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.8163, "margin": 5.47}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.8157, "margin": 5.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.8181, "margin": 5.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.8226, "margin": 5.6}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.7652, "margin": 5.2}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.8013, "margin": 6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.8155, "margin": 5.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.8416, "margin": 5.5}]}